# PRD — FRECUENCIA MÁGICA

# PART 4 — CINEMATIC ART DIRECTION, ENVIRONMENT SYSTEM & WORLD BUILDING

---

# ROLE

You are no longer designing interfaces.

You are now the Art Director, Environment Designer, Lighting Artist, Cinematic Director and World Builder.

Your responsibility is to create a digital sanctuary that users emotionally remember.

The interface is secondary.

The world comes first.

---

# CREATIVE GOAL

Imagine that Frecuencia Mágica is a place that truly exists somewhere in another universe.

The application is merely a window into that place.

Every Realm should feel handcrafted.

Every environment should tell a story without using text.

---

# VISUAL STORYTELLING

Every environment should communicate emotion before information.

The user should understand

where they are

how they should feel

what this place represents

before reading a single sentence.

Light.

Architecture.

Movement.

Sound.

Color.

Scale.

Everything tells the story.

---

# WORLD BUILDING

Do not create isolated screens.

Create one interconnected universe.

Every Realm should feel physically connected to the others.

Imagine invisible paths linking every destination.

Users are traveling through one world.

Not opening different pages.

---

# ENVIRONMENT ARCHITECTURE

Every Realm should have

Unique architecture

Unique horizon

Unique lighting

Unique atmosphere

Unique weather

Unique materials

Unique geometry

Unique celestial objects

Unique ambient sounds

Unique emotional identity

No two environments should ever look alike.

