# FINAL ART DIRECTION

Do not design a UI.

Do not design a website.

Design a place that people wish existed in real life.

If someone takes a screenshot of any screen, it should look like a piece of cinematic concept art.

Every Realm should be worthy of being printed as a poster.

The final prototype should feel less like software and more like **an explorable digital sanctuary suspended somewhere between a dream, a planetarium, an ancient temple and a work of interactive art**.
